  "origin": "Records of the Danish Parliament (Folketinget) and former Landstinget from the 1848/49 parliamentary year through May 2026: bills, proposed resolutions, proceedings, and questions from MPs to ministers. Combines born-digital modern documents with OCR-processed historical material. Rigsarkivet published 125,406 documents as delivery 14004 (DOI 10.5279/dk-ra-14004). Personal names were pseudonymised before release; naturalisation/citizenship documents were excluded because foreign names could not be pseudonymised reliably. 124.51K samples, 2.81B Llama-3 tokens.",
